WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:11.826
Bird flew around the tree. "Kip!"

2
00:00:11.827 --> 00:00:16.866
she cried. "Where are you?" She looked

3
00:00:16.867 --> 00:00:24.007
at every branch. Bird didn't see Kip.

4
00:00:24.008 --> 00:00:28.957
She landed near the bottom of the

5
00:00:28.958 --> 00:00:31.082
tree.

6
00:00:31.083 --> 00:00:36.045
"Poor Kip!" Bird cried.

7
00:00:36.046 --> 00:00:39.950
Pop! Kip jumped out

8
00:00:39.951 --> 00:00:43.507
of a hole. "Ahh!" Bird cried. "I

9
00:00:43.508 --> 00:00:46.117
found a new home!"

10
00:00:46.118 --> 00:00:51.818
Kip said. "I thought

11
00:00:51.819 --> 00:00:59.347
a hawk got you!" Bird

12
00:00:59.348 --> 00:01:05.341
said. She sighed. "But I'm

13
00:01:05.342 --> 00:01:11.321
glad you found a home."

14
00:01:11.322 --> 00:01:15.524
Bird made a nest

15
00:01:15.525 --> 00:01:18.447
up in the tree. Kip

16
00:01:18.448 --> 00:01:23.000
cleaned the hole. Together

17
00:01:23.001 --> 00:01:26.941
they moved their things. Kip set up

18
00:01:26.942 --> 00:01:30.675
his bed. He set up his

19
00:01:30.676 --> 00:01:33.839
kitchen. Bird put

20
00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:37.574
away her knitting things. She put away

21
00:01:37.575 --> 00:01:40.822
her stamps. Bird found an acorn. "This is

22
00:01:40.823 --> 00:01:45.580
Kip's acorn," she thought. "Kip!"

23
00:01:45.581 --> 00:01:50.289
Bird called. Kip looked out of his

24
00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:53.525
hole. "Yes?" Bird dropped

25
00:01:53.526 --> 00:01:56.000
the acorn. Bonk!

26
00:01:56.001 --> 00:02:00.931
"Oops! Sorry, Kip!" Bird grinned.

